{# =====================================================
   CUSTOMER STORIES — WEBSITE V2
   Redesigned onto the homepage-v2 design system (navbar-v2 +
   footer-v2 chrome, Inter type, navy/#76B900 token language,
   font-mono uppercase labels, hairline-border glass cards) with
   section composition, rhythm and    card polish taking cues from
   the Kore.ai customer-stories reference: split featured-story
   card, bordered logo strip, card-style story grid, stat band,
   dark closing CTA. Hero copy, featured story, logo strip,
   stat band and closing CTA match the original. The story-grid
   testimonials were re-authored to map 1:1 to the real clients
   in the logo carousel (role-based attribution, case-study-
   grounded results) replacing the earlier dummy Twitter-style
   placeholder contributors.

   The scrolling-testimonial marquee (animate-marquee-left/right,
   .marquee-fade/.marquee-container/.marquee-track) referenced no
   CSS anywhere in the codebase — it was inert. Rebuilt as a
   self-contained keyframe recipe (matching homepage-v2.njk's
   .animate-marquee pattern) so the existing content actually
   scrolls, same two-row/opposite-direction structure as before.
   ===================================================== #}

{% include "partials/navbar-v2.njk" %}

